    <briefdescription>
<para>Outline color and width, exposed as a <computeroutput>border</computeroutput> grouped property, for example <computeroutput>border.width: 1</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used by <computeroutput>PlotView</computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1RectangleSeries" kindref="compound">RectangleSeries</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1BarSeries" kindref="compound">BarSeries</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput>PlotView.rectangleZoom</computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1SelectionTool" kindref="compound">SelectionTool</ref></computeroutput>, and <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1ColorBar" kindref="compound">ColorBar</ref></computeroutput>. Each owner documents its defaults and where the outline is drawn. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
